{"seq":2,"slug":"immutable-pricing-plan-snapshots","title":"不可变价格计划与订阅快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/aggregation-and-pricing/immutable-pricing-plan-snapshots","wordCount":1386,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"不可变价格计划与订阅快照\">不可变价格计划与订阅快照</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>价格不是一个可编辑的数字，而是一组共同决定金额的规则：计价单位、币种、阶梯、最小额、舍入、账期、税前或税后语义、生效区间和适用维度。若管理员原地把单价从 0.01 改成 0.02，历史用量重算会得到另一张账单，审计失去依据。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/products-prices/manage-prices?locale=en-GB\">Stripe 的价格管理文档</a>说明，价格创建后只能更新少量非经济字段，金额变化应创建新 Price 并停用旧 Price。自己的价格目录也应采用这一不可变版本模式，并在客户订阅时保存精确绑定，而不是每次计算都按“当前套餐名”查价格。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    C[产品目录草稿] --&gt; V[价格版本发布]&#10;    V --&gt; B[订阅绑定快照]&#10;    U[用量切片] --&gt; R[定价运行]&#10;    B --&gt; R&#10;    R --&gt; L[金额行与解释]&#10;    V --&gt; N[新版本]&#10;    N -.仅影响新绑定或显式迁移.-&gt; B\">flowchart LR\n    C[产品目录草稿] --&gt; V[价格版本发布]\n    V --&gt; B[订阅绑定快照]\n    U[用量切片] --&gt; R[定价运行]\n    B --&gt; R\n    R --&gt; L[金额行与解释]\n    V --&gt; N[新版本]\n    N -.仅影响新绑定或显式迁移.-&gt; B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>身份</th>\n<th>是否可变</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>product</code></td>\n<td>稳定产品语义</td>\n<td>展示信息可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>price_plan_version</code></td>\n<td>一组完整经济规则</td>\n<td>发布后不可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>subscription_binding</code></td>\n<td>客户与价格版本的生效关系</td>\n<td>以新绑定记录变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pricing_run</code></td>\n<td>一次确定性计算</td>\n<td>不可变，可产生新 revision</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>invoice_candidate_line</code></td>\n<td>待交付金额解释</td>\n<td>通过替代或调整演进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>同章的<a href=\"aggregation-windows-and-event-time\">聚合窗口</a>提供数量与账期；本节只解释数量如何按被订阅的规则变成金额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格版本的完整内容\">价格版本的完整内容</h2><p>价格版本至少包含 <code>price_version_id</code>、产品与 meter、计价单位、币种、计费周期、计价模型、阶梯数组、免费额度、最小或封顶金额、舍入模式、生效时间、目录修订和内容哈希。显示名称与营销文案可独立演进，不进入经济哈希。</p>\n<p>阶梯必须声明是 graduated 还是 volume。前者对每段用量应用不同单价，后者根据总量选择一个单价应用全部用量。设总量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 段上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，graduated 的概念金额为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(q) = \\sum_i p_i \\cdot \\max\\left(0, \\min(q, b_i) - b_{i-1}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Volume 价格则先按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 选择一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(q)=p_kq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>。两者在跨阶梯时可能产生完全不同的边际金额，不能只用一个 <code>tiers</code> 数组而不记录模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订阅绑定与时间切片\">订阅绑定与时间切片</h2><p>客户购买时创建 <code>subscription_binding</code>，固定 <code>subject_id</code>、<code>price_version_id</code>、有效区间、账期锚点、数量或承诺、折扣版本和权益包版本。套餐升级不更新原绑定，而是在明确切换时间结束旧绑定并创建新绑定。</p>\n<p>账期内变更有三种可选政策：下个账期生效、按时间比例拆分、立即切换但不追溯。政策必须成为订阅合同的一部分。计量系统先按绑定有效区间切分用量，再分别定价；不能先把整月总量定价后按天数比例分摊，因为阶梯与封顶会让两种结果不同。</p>\n<p>绑定快照还解决供应商映射漂移。内部 <code>price_version_id</code> 映射到外部 price ID，但外部 ID 只是交付句柄。即使供应商停用或迁移，内部历史仍能独立复算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"舍入-币种与信用单位\">舍入、币种与信用单位</h2><p>金额采用币种最小单位整数或带币种的十进制定点值对象。价格版本声明计算精度和舍入点：逐事件舍入、逐阶梯舍入、逐行舍入或发票总额舍入会产生不同结果。通常先以更高内部精度累计，在发票行边界按明确模式舍入，并保存舍入差额。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>能否直接混算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>产品用量</td>\n<td>token、image、second</td>\n<td>仅同 meter 同单位可加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部产品信用</td>\n<td>credit</td>\n<td>需要版本化兑换规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货币</td>\n<td>USD cent、CNY fen</td>\n<td>不同币种不可直接加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商成本</td>\n<td>provider USD</td>\n<td>仅用于成本分析，不等于客户价格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>“一个信用等于若干 token”只有在指定价格版本和资源范围后才有意义。信用扣减应先定价得到货币或内部信用消耗，再写信用账本；不要在事件生产者中写死兑换率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发布-迁移与回滚\">发布、迁移与回滚</h2><p>发布流程分为草稿校验、影子定价、审批、激活和订阅迁移。影子定价用过去若干封闭账期比较旧版与新版的客户金额分布，检查零金额、极端跳变、阶梯不连续和币种错误。审批记录包含差异摘要与预期业务效果。</p>\n<p>已发布版本不能回滚修改；所谓回滚是停止新绑定并重新激活旧版本供后续绑定，已迁移客户是否回迁由明确迁移任务决定。每个迁移任务记录客户集合快照、旧新版本、切换时间、预览差额、执行状态和幂等键。</p>\n<p>定价引擎应提供解释树：输入切片、命中的绑定、各阶梯数量、免费额度、折扣、舍入和最终金额。测试不仅断言总额，还断言解释节点，避免重构后“金额碰巧相同、语义已经改变”。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价格版本是一组完整经济规则，发布后不可原地编辑。</li>\n<li>订阅绑定固定精确版本和有效区间，套餐名不是历史依据。</li>\n<li>账期内升级先切分用量再分别定价，不能无条件按天数分摊总额。</li>\n<li>阶梯模型、币种、精度与舍入点都进入版本哈希。</li>\n<li>产品用量、内部信用、货币和供应商成本保持单位隔离。</li>\n<li>新价格通过影子定价和显式迁移发布，异常由<a href=\"late-events-corrections-reconciliation\">迟到与对账流程</a>收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不可变价格计划与订阅快照","id":"不可变价格计划与订阅快照"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价格版本的完整内容","id":"价格版本的完整内容"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅绑定与时间切片","id":"订阅绑定与时间切片"},{"level":2,"text":"舍入、币种与信用单位","id":"舍入-币种与信用单位"},{"level":2,"text":"发布、迁移与回滚","id":"发布-迁移与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"聚合窗口、事件时间与最终性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/aggregation-and-pricing/aggregation-windows-and-event-time"},"next":{"title":"迟到事件、更正与对账收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-usage-metering-entitlements/aggregation-and-pricing/late-events-corrections-reconciliation"}}